  "body": "Follow-up of #1953 (item 3: one named layout test for each page or dialog).\n\nPR for #1953 adds `layout_page_<page>` for each property page and `layout_window_debug_info`. These windows and modals have no named layout test yet:\n- \"Post refused\" window (`post_refusal.rs`)\n- unsaved prompt modal (`unsaved_prompt.rs`)\n- fixture library modal (`fixture_library_dialog.rs`, with the vise, plate and accessory bodies)\n- Machines dock pane (`Tab::Machines`)\n- G-code window: `gcode_viewer.rs` has layout clauses inside behaviour tests; give it its own `layout_window_gcode`.\n\nWhat to do: add one small test for each in `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/page_layout.rs`, with the same coarse law (the window is inside the screen, its anchor widgets are inside it and stack top to bottom).\n\nDone means: each window and modal in the list has a `layout_window_<name>` test.\n",
